{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"# Napstablook\n👮 A Hometown police officer alongside Undyne — a job they got \"by accident\" and one they don't dare resign from because their cousins depend on them."},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Napstablook.webp"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Undyne**\nTheir coworker at the police station. She genuinely worries about them when they disappear."},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","x":-130,"y":-870,"width":220,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Napstablook_overworld_ground.png"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Mad Mew Mew (Pink)**\nTheir cousin, whom they live with at the Blook House along with Nobody."},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","x":420,"y":-480,"width":220,"height":150,"file":"Sprites/Napstablook_screenshot_strength_tester.png"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":-580,"y":164,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"**The Snail (Ch.4)**\nHe appears getting run over harmlessly again and again while trying to direct traffic alone — the Snail himself admits that, with no police watching, he can finally go \"as slow as he wants\"."},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","x":-880,"y":194,"width":190,"height":143,"file":"Sprites/Napstablook_overworld_ground.png"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":320,"y":380,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"**The escape-alarm remix**\nThe alarm that sounds after the Wet-Nose Bandits' escape is, in fact, a remix Napstablook made of their own tape — consistent with their well-known love, from Undertale, of remixing their own songs."},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","x":640,"y":410,"width":190,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/napstabloock_Chill_Jailbreak_Alarm_To_Study_And_Relax_To_soundtrack.png"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_caracol_undyne","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}